    <criterion>Interfaces renamed: `ISpeContainerTypeProvisioner` → `ISpeContainerProvisioner`. `ISpeContainerIdKvWriter` deleted (no more per-customer KV write). Namespace `SpeContainerType` → `SpeContainer` throughout.</criterion>
