    <criterion>Build passes: `dotnet build src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/` + `dotnet test tests/unit/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core.Tests/` — 0 errors, 0 test failures.</criterion>
